{"overview":"همبرگرهای باب یک رستوران‌دار نسل سوم به نام باب را دنبال می‌کند که با کمک همسرش و سه فرزندشان همبرگرهای باب را اداره می‌کند. باب و خانواده عجیب و غریبش نقشه‌های بزرگی در مورد همبرگر دارند، اما در خدمات و ظرافت کار کوتاهی می‌کنند. با وجود میزهای چرب، موقعیت مکانی خیلی بد و تعداد کم مشتری، باب و خانواده‌اش مصمم هستند تا \"بازگشایی چندباره بزرگ\" همبرگرهای باب را به یک موفقیت تبدیل کنند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Bob's Burgers follows a third-generation restaurateur, Bob, as he runs Bob's Burgers with the help of his wife and their three kids. Bob and his quirky family have big ideas about burgers, but fall short on service and sophistication. Despite the greasy counters, lousy location and a dearth of customers, Bob and his family are determined to make Bob's Burgers \"grand re-re-re-opening\" a success.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":3,"y":2012,"poster":"/veZhEZuyIwMYhmN8ngSf9IMIREa.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":13,"y":2011,"poster":"/g6VoXS3pO6e5CZrarMlECBiPehn.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":9,"y":2012,"poster":"/lopl0VHBXZqsEaFUCZ6ckjB0hWn.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":23,"y":2012,"poster":"/g1BW2O4iuCMXlcutq5EKGL8CYe2.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":22,"y":2013,"poster":"/uxh34mwqZp8ZQrb1HE3jjVCRoMp.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":21,"y":2014,"poster":"/hSSq0pumcqPXU03GQnc4MxSYNgH.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":19,"y":2015,"poster":"/8N63WszFxp67ZVnLMUgTFyz0GhJ.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":22,"y":2016,"poster":"/mXvn5c7D5iva4P5SC93L6cuYIkA.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":21,"y":2017,"poster":"/3l8k1XSh9JofNS9g9EFvjTq6nNv.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":22,"y":2018,"poster":"/t7z66Bt6n43ZJatBCp0Ckk97ge7.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":22,"y":2019,"poster":"/xyJXbvdiUtWMr9b7tOI4QbKpTvy.jpg"},{"n":11,"name":"فصل 11","ep":22,"y":2020,"poster":"/cHod7WdSd7AVJtfDywWzKOrXF6v.jpg"},{"n":12,"name":"فصل 12","ep":22,"y":2021,"poster":"/5EnZKgD4Sbpf1fxr4Zr1fD8v49z.jpg"},{